# Security headers for pinkyswear.asdfghjk.lol (Cloudflare Pages reads this file).
# No CSP yet: the app loads pinned CDN libraries and fetches user-supplied logo URLs,
# so a policy needs an inventory first (README "Production limitations").
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), geolocation=(self), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()

/service-worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
